# 3. THE OVERALL VISION

Hastkala must provide two connected experiences.

### Customer experience

Customers discover authentic handmade products, learn about their makers, explore craft traditions, save products, purchase items, and contact artisans or request bulk quotations where supported.

### Artisan experience

